## Install

1. Download `__ARTIFACT_NAME__` and its matching `.sha256` file from this private GitHub Release.
2. Extract it:

```sh
shasum -a 256 -c __ARTIFACT_NAME__.sha256
tar -xzf __ARTIFACT_NAME__
cd __ARCHIVE_ROOT__
./damsel --help
./damsel doctor --help
```

